; MystTiqConsoleProxy exports, at the EXACT ordinals the real system dsound.dll uses (confirmed via
; `dumpbin /exports C:\Windows\System32\dsound.dll`). PalServer-Win64-Shipping-Cmd.exe imports
; DSOUND.dll by ordinal, not by name (confirmed via `dumpbin /imports` against the real binary), so
; ordinal position here must match exactly or the loader resolves the wrong function.
LIBRARY MystTiqConsoleProxy
EXPORTS
    DirectSoundCreate               @1
    DirectSoundEnumerateW           @3
    DirectSoundCaptureCreate        @6
    DirectSoundCaptureEnumerateW    @8
    DirectSoundCreate8              @11
    DirectSoundCaptureCreate8       @12
